\par\b\fs28 A2. Connecting hypotheses\b0\fs24\par


\par Hypothesis 1 (one axis): the centre is Source alone \u8212? all is gift; the human receives. History and response stay in the background.\par


\par Hypothesis 2 (relation): the centre is Source \u8596? Trajectory, with a Coherence hinge \u8212? the unchanging Rock against a heart that forgets over time, and that forgetting becomes visible in how one treats the other (Matt. 18).\par


\par Which explains the most data with the least strain? Hypothesis 2. It explains the history-character of the song (Trajectory), the waxing-fat reversal (32:15), and why Matt. 18 was chosen. Hypothesis 1 leaves the reversal and the gospel unexplained.\par


\par What would refute this reading? If the song knew no reversal and Matt. 18 stood apart from the forgetting-motif, the weight would lie with Source alone.\par



